  m_text: "20 seconds. Grab the loot. Get out.\n\nWASD \u2014 Move\nMouse \u2014
    Look\nShift \u2014 Sprint\nSpace \u2014 Jump  \n\nThe countdown starts when you
    move.\nSprint stamina is limited and does not regenerate.\nCollect treasure and
    escape before time runs out.\nFind a key to unlock the crown room.\nEscape with
    the crown to double your loot.\nFalling onto spikes or running out of time loses
    the run."
